{"id":"espacial","lemma":"espacial","pos":"adj","rank":1955,"glosses":["spatial (pertaining to the dimension of space)","spatial (pertaining to outer space)"],"ipa":"/espaˈθjal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"espaciales"},"order":1988,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-espacial.wav","examples":[{"text":"La nave espacial hizo un aterrizaje perfecto.","en":"The spaceship made a perfect landing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689167","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"ship, vessel"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"landing"},{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Los viajes espaciales son peligrosos.","en":"Space travel is dangerous.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"voyage","l":"viaje"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"perilous, dangerous","l":"peligroso"}]},{"text":"Se pensaba que los viajes espaciales eran imposibles.","en":"Space travel was thought to be impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/931352","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"voyage","l":"viaje"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"impossible","l":"imposible"}]}]}